--[[

  Luminex GigaCore Q-SYS Plugin
  Author: Daniel Minville <daniel.minville@luminexamerica.com>

  To add a new GigaCore model:
    1. Add its name and port count to GigaCoreModels.
       e.g., ["GigaCore 48"] = 48

]]

